t. Some clients will show this text as a preview. --></span>\n            <table class=\"main\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; width: 100%; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 3px;margin-top: 10px;\">\n\n              <!-- START MAIN CONTENT AREA -->\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"wrapper\" style=\"font-family: \'Roboto Slab\', \'Roboto\', \'Arial\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: top; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 20px 40px;\">\n                  <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; width: 100%;\">\n                    <tr>\n                      <td align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;background-color: #bb3430\">\n                        <div class=\"pageicon\" style=\"overflow: hidden;padding-top:30px;\">\n                        </div>\n                        <h2 style=\"font-weight: 400;color: #fff;padding-bottom: 27px;border-bottom: 0px solid #c7c7c7;margin: 0px;\">\n                          Reset Password\n                        </h2>\n                      </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                      <td style=\"font-family: \'Roboto Slab\', \'Roboto\', \'Arial\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: top;padding: 50px 20px 30px 20px;\">\n                        <p style=\"font-family: \'Roboto Slab\', \'Roboto\', \'Arial\', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0; margin-bottom: 15px;\">Dear Sir/Madam</p>\n                        <p style=\"font-family: \'Roboto Slab\', \'Roboto\', \'Arial\', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: normal; margin: 0; margin-bottom: 5px;\">Greetings From QAT!!! </p>\n                        <p style=\"font-family: \'Roboto Slab\', \'Roboto\', \'Arial\', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: normal; margin: 0; margin-bottom: 15px;\">We received a request to reset the password for your account.Please click on the below button to reset your password.</p>\n <p style=\"font-family: \'Roboto Slab\', \'Roboto\', \'Arial\', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: normal; margin: 0; margin-bottom: 5px;\">Username : <%USERNAME%></p>\n                        <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box;margin: 30px 0px;\">\n                          <tbody>\n                            <tr>\n                              <td align=\"left\" style=\"font-family: \'Roboto Slab\', \'Roboto\', \'Arial\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: top;\">\n                                <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; width: auto;\">\n                                  <tbody>\n                                    <tr>\n                                      <td style=\"font-family: \'Roboto Slab\', \'Roboto\', \'Arial\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: top; background-color: #00abc5; border-radius: 5px; text-align: center;\"> \n                                          <a href=\"<%HOST_URL%>/<%PASSWORD_RESET_URL%>/<%EMAIL_ID%>/<%TOKEN%>\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display: inline-block; color: #fff; background-color: #bb3430; border: solid 1px #00abc5; border-radius: 5px; box-sizing: border-box; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; margin: 0; padding: 8px 18px; text-transform: capitalize; border-color: #00abc5;\">   Reset Password\n                                          </a> \n                                      </td>\n                                    </tr>\n                                  </tbody>\n                                </table>\n                              </td>\n                            </tr>\n                          </tbody>\n                        </table>\n                        <b>Password Policy:</b><br>\n                        <p>1) Password has to be at least 6 characters</p><p>2) Password should not contain password string</p><p>3) Password must contain atleast 1 special character</p><p>4) Password must contain atleast 1 number</p><p>5) Password must contain atleast 1 uppercase alphabet</p><p>6) Password must start with alphabet</p><p>7) New password should not be same as username</p><p>8) New password should not be same as old password</p>\n                        <p style=\"font-family: \'Roboto Slab\', \'Roboto\', \'Arial\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; margin: 0; margin-bottom: 15px;border-bottom: 1px dashed #c7c7c7;padding-bottom: 20px;color:red\">Note:The reset password link is valid for 24 hours only.</p>\n                        <p style=\"font-family: \'Roboto Slab\', \'Roboto\', \'Arial\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; margin: 0; margin-bottom: 15px;padding-bottom: 20px;\">\n                            Thanks,<br>\n                            Team QAT\n                        </p>\n                      </td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </table>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n\n            <!-- END MAIN CONTENT AREA -->\n            </table>\n          <!-- END CENTERED WHITE CONTAINER -->\n          </div>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"font-family: \'Roboto Slab\', \'Roboto\', \'Arial\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; vertical-align: top;\">&nbsp;</td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n  </body>\n</html>','USERNAME,HOST_URL,PASSWORD_RESET_URL,EMAIL_ID,TOKEN',NULL,1,'2020-02-20 12:00:00',1,'2020-02-20 12:00:00',1,NULL,NULL),(2,'New user creation','QAT login credentials',NULL,'<!doctype html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n    <title>Default Template</title>\n    <style>\n 